  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The objective of the GEF PPG Floods is to Enhance the adaptative capacity to floods and water security in S&#xe3;o Tom&#xe9; and Principe, by increase (1) the resilience of urban areas and vulnerable communities to the impacts of climate change-driven floods and (2) water security in S&#xe3;o Tome and Principe.</narrative>
